{
  "_doc": "Goal chain shown 3 at a time in the HUD (in order; a goal completes the moment its condition holds). type: stat (GameState.stats[key] >= target), earned (lifetime cubes earned), upgrade (upgrade key level), robot (robots of type key in this district, key 'any' = all), tier (fleet Mk tier of robot type key; 'any' = best), zone (hexes painted into Command zones, key B), hub_level (base level), hex_level (hexes in this district at level >= key), flag (GameState.flags[key] truthy), launch (launch progress 0..1), city_stage (regrowth stage of the city named by key; empty key = the current city), cities_restored (cities at the launch stage; these three are the planet measures of systems/restoration.gd), districts (districts visited), research (research node key done), bases_l5 (bases at level 5 across districts), frontier_base (base level of frontier kind key), frontier_growing (lowest share of land Growing+ over the three frontiers). reward: paid the moment the goal's condition holds, wherever the goal stands in the chain (never held back for the card, never in a burst). A reward is in the currency of the action that earned it and small (design spec section 14: never more than about 3 minutes of income): cubes for cleaning, selling, earning, upgrading and building at the base; seeds for planting and regrowth; a Part for digging parts up; nothing but the Lumi XP for crew and side goals (Parts come from salvage alone). after_flag: the goal is offered only once that save flag is set, and then comes before the rest of the chain (first_piece = the first piece of a look was found: design spec section 13).",
